on, it will be called with the mount element\n    name: (el) => {\n      el.innerText = \"Your Plugin Name\"\n      // Your name logic here\n    },\n    render: () => {}\n  }","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"render","children":[{"type":"text","value":"render()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"render: (el, theme) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L72","children":[{"type":"text","value":"devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:72"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render the plugin UI by using the provided element. This function will be called\nwhen the plugin tab is clicked and expected to be mounted."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"el","children":[{"type":"text","value":"el"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HTMLDivElement"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The mount element for the plugin."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"theme","children":[{"type":"text","value":"theme"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"light\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"dark\""}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"void"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"  render: (el) => {\n    el.innerHTML = \"<h1>Your Plugin</h1>\"\n  }","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-tanstackdevtoolsplugin","text":"Interface: TanStackDevtoolsPlugin","level":1},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"defaultopen","text":"defaultOpen?","level":3},{"id":"default","text":"Default","level":4},{"id":"destroy","text":"destroy()?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"pluginid","text":"pluginId","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"id","text":"id?","level":3},{"id":"name","text":"name","level":3},{"id":"render","text":"render()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"el","text":"el","level":5},{"id":"theme","text":"theme","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n<!-- DO NOT EDIT: this page is autogenerated from the type comments -->\n\n# Interface: TanStackDevtoolsPlugin\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:15](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L15)\n\n## Properties\n\n### defaultOpen?\n\n```ts\noptional defaultOpen: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:58](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L58)\n\nWhether the plugin should be open by default when there are no active plugins.\nIf true, this plugin will be added to activePlugins on initial load when activePlugins is empty.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\nfalse\n```\n\n***\n\n### destroy()?\n\n```ts\noptional destroy: (pluginId) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:77](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L77)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### pluginId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### id?\n\n```ts\noptional id: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:52](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L52)\n\nUnique identifier for the plugin.\nIf not provided, it will be generated based on the name.\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: string | (el, theme) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:42](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L42)\n\nName to be displayed in the devtools UI.\nIf a string, it will be used as the plugin name.\nIf a function, it will be called with the mount element.\n\nExample:\n```ts\n  {\n    // If a string, it will be used as the plugin name\n    name: \"Your Plugin\",\n    render: () => {}\n  }\n```\nor\n\n```ts\n  {\n    // If a function, it will be called with the mount element\n    name: (el) => {\n      el.innerText = \"Your Plugin Name\"\n      // Your name logic here\n    },\n    render: () => {}\n  }\n```\n\n***\n\n### render()\n\n```ts\nrender: (el, theme) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:72](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L72)\n\nRender the plugin UI by using the provided element. This function will be called\nwhen the plugin tab is clicked and expected to be mounted.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### el\n\n`HTMLDivElement`\n\nThe mount element for the plugin.\n\n##### theme\n\n`\"light\"` | `\"dark\"`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\nvoid\n\nExample:\n```ts\n  render: (el) => {\n    el.innerHTML = \"<h1>Your Plugin</h1>\"\n  }\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TanStackDevtoolsPlugin\ntitle: TanStackDevtoolsPlugin\n---\n\n<!-- DO NOT EDIT: this page is autogenerated from the type comments -->\n\n# Interface: TanStackDevtoolsPlugin\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:15](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L15)\n\n## Properties\n\n### defaultOpen?\n\n```ts\noptional defaultOpen: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:58](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L58)\n\nWhether the plugin should be open by default when there are no active plugins.\nIf true, this plugin will be added to activePlugins on initial load when activePlugins is empty.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\nfalse\n```\n\n***\n\n### destroy()?\n\n```ts\noptional destroy: (pluginId) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:77](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L77)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### pluginId\n\n`string`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### id?\n\n```ts\noptional id: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:52](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L52)\n\nUnique identifier for the plugin.\nIf not provided, it will be generated based on the name.\n\n***\n\n### name\n\n```ts\nname: string | (el, theme) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:42](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L42)\n\nName to be displayed in the devtools UI.\nIf a string, it will be used as the plugin name.\nIf a function, it will be called with the mount element.\n\nExample:\n```ts\n  {\n    // If a string, it will be used as the plugin name\n    name: \"Your Plugin\",\n    render: () => {}\n  }\n```\nor\n\n```ts\n  {\n    // If a function, it will be called with the mount element\n    name: (el) => {\n      el.innerText = \"Your Plugin Name\"\n      // Your name logic here\n    },\n    render: () => {}\n  }\n```\n\n***\n\n### render()\n\n```ts\nrender: (el, theme) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx:72](https://github.com/TanStack/devtools/blob/main/packages/devtools/src/context/devtools-context.tsx#L72)\n\nRender the plugin UI by using the provided element. This function will be called\nwhen the plugin tab is clicked and expected to be mounted.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### el\n\n`HTMLDivElement`\n\nThe mount element for the plugin.\n\n##### theme\n\n`\"light\"` | `\"dark\"`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\nvoid\n\nExample:\n```ts\n  render: (el) => {\n    el.innerHTML = \"<h1>Your Plugin</h1>\"\n  }\n```\n"}
